Monolayer BN - BerkeleyGW
=========================

In this directory, we will perform all the GW/GW-BSE calculations using
BerkeleyGW.


Instructions
------------

  1. First, run the script ``./01-link_files.sh``. It will create links for the
     epsmat (dielectric matrix) files and the bsemat (BSE kernel) files.
 
  2. Go to each directory in the numeric order they appear and follow the instructions
     in the README.
